1
00:00:00,104 --> 00:00:05,014
Hello little chefs I'm Chef Maya Let's

2
00:00:05,014 --> 00:00:07,438
make a crispy masala dosa together

3
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:12,074
Wash your hands first Ask a grown-up

4
00:00:12,074 --> 00:00:15,063
to use the hot stove and utensils

5
00:00:15,063 --> 00:00:16,618
We can watch and learn

6
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:20,900
We need dosa batter cooked potato filling

7
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:24,220
a little oil and chutney Everything is

8
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:24,945
ready

9
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:29,669
Our grown-up warms a lightly oiled pan

10
00:00:29,669 --> 00:00:31,870
Scoop up the batter then gently pour

11
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:33,017
