23
00:01:04,681 --> 00:01:05,909
the yummy filling

24
00:01:07,368 --> 00:01:10,457
Slide our dosa onto a plate Turn

25
00:01:10,457 --> 00:01:13,310
off the stove Let it cool before

26
00:01:13,310 --> 00:01:17,066
